OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786205893
OL,3,CSpain imposes border checks on Italian
OL,4,Cvisitors in row over Ceuta migrants
OL,6,FA diplomatic row has deepened between
OL,7,FSpain and Italy following the crossing
OL,8,Fof tens of thousands of migrants into
OL,9,Fthe Spanish territory of Ceuta last
OL,10,Fmonth.
OL,12,FMadrid announced border controls on
OL,13,FItalian travellers on Saturday in
OL,14,Fresponse to Rome's earlier decision to
OL,15,Fimpose restrictions on visitors from
OL,16,FSpain.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
