OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786205893
OL,3,CSpain imposes border checks on Italian
OL,4,Cvisitors in row over Ceuta migrants
OL,6,FItalians arriving at Barcelona airport
OL,7,Fwere subject to random police checks
OL,8,Fafter the controls were put into
OL,9,Feffect overnight, according to Spain's
OL,10,Fstate news agency EFE.
OL,12,FSpain's government said the controls
OL,13,Fwould stay in place for at least a
OL,14,Fmonth, after warning it would take
OL,15,F"proportionate measures to protect the
OL,16,Finterests and dignity of its citizens"
OL,17,Fif Rome didn't lift its own
OL,18,Frestrictions by August 9.
