OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786205893
OL,3,CSpain imposes border checks on Italian
OL,4,Cvisitors in row over Ceuta migrants
OL,6,FAn influx of people crossing the
OL,7,Fborder of Morocco into the Spanish
OL,8,Fenclave of Ceuta in late July stunned
OL,9,Fthe national and local governments of
OL,10,FSpain, with Madrid deploying the
OL,11,Fmilitary on Friday to try and contain
OL,12,Fthe situation.
OL,14,FSome 72,000 migrants arrived, and
OL,15,Falthough most have since gone back,
OL,16,Fmore than 80 died, including some who
OL,17,Fdrowned or were trampled in a stampede
OL,18,Fto cross a breakwater barrier.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
