PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786205893
OL,3,CSpain imposes border checks on Italian
OL,4,Cvisitors in row over Ceuta migrants
OL,6,FThis prompted a scathing criticism by
OL,7,FItalian Prime Minister Giorgia Meloni
OL,8,Fof her Spanish counterpart Pedro
OL,9,FSanchez's migration policies,
OL,10,Fsuggesting that they were responsible
OL,11,Ffor the massive influx.
OL,13,FOn August 1 Rome imposed identity
OL,14,Fchecks on people arriving by plane or
OL,15,Fboat from Spain ` a challenge to the
OL,16,FEU's Schengen agreement.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
