PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786205893
OL,3,CSpain imposes border checks on Italian
OL,4,Cvisitors in row over Ceuta migrants
OL,6,FWithin the European Union there is a
OL,7,Fvisa-free travel area known as
OL,8,FSchengen, which allows citizens of
OL,9,Fmost EU countries to travel easily
OL,10,Facross borders.
OL,12,FAccording to the EU, member states are
OL,13,Fallowed to temporarily reintroduce
OL,14,Fcontrols at the EU's so-called
OL,15,Finternal borders in case of a serious
OL,16,Fthreat, such as one to internal
OL,17,Fsecurity.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786205893
OL,3,CSpain imposes border checks on Italian
OL,4,Cvisitors in row over Ceuta migrants
OL,6,FBut it also says border controls
OL,7,Fshould be applied as a last resort in
OL,8,Fexceptional situations, and must be
OL,9,Ftime-limited.
OL,11,FMeloni's office said on Friday that
OL,12,FItalian authorities "have no
OL,13,Fintention" of lifting border checks on
OL,14,Fpeople arriving from Spain by sea or
OL,15,Fair until at least August 15.
OL,17,F"Italy does not accept ultimatums or
OL,18,Fimpositions from abroad about national
OL,19,Fsecurity and border control," a
OL,20,Fstatement said.
OL,26,@tD@UOUuD@JO]yD@AOU{D@]O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
