OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786205893
OL,3,CSpain imposes border checks on Italian
OL,4,Cvisitors in row over Ceuta migrants
OL,6,FFollowing Spain's retaliatory
OL,7,Fmeasures, Italy's ministry of foreign
OL,8,Faffairs announced on Saturday that it
OL,9,Fwould strengthen its assistance of
OL,10,FItalians currently in Spain.
OL,12,FShould there be a repeat of migrant
OL,13,Farrivals in Ceuta, Italy would review
OL,14,Fits decision to impose the checks
OL,15,F"only when we are certain that there
OL,16,Fwill be no security or terrorist risks
OL,17,Ffor Italy, that there will be no new
OL,18,Fwave, and that there are no irregular
OL,19,Fmigrants heading towards European
OL,20,Fterritory," the statement added.
OL,26,@wD@AOU|D@KO]
